    "created_at": "2021-03-18T16:52:08Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-03-18T16:52:08Z",
    "body": "This is probably because fish loads your `~/.config.fish` even in non-interactive cases like this. To speed this up, try using bash as the shell for that command:\r\n\r\n```toml\r\n[custom.fish]\r\ncommand = \"echo 🐟 \"\r\nwhen = \"\"\" test \"$STARSHIP_SHELL\" = \"fish\" \"\"\"\r\nformat = \"$output\"\r\nshell = [\"bash\", \"--noprofile\", \"--norc\"]\r\n```",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
